  "id": "vigilance-decrement",
  "term": "vigilance decrement",
  "definition": "Vigilance decrement is the drop in sustained-attention performance that happens as time on task increases, especially during long, repetitive monitoring tasks. It usually means people become less likely to notice infrequent important signals over time.",
